==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|nādele}}, from {{inh|de|goh|nādala}}, from {{inh|de|gem-pro|*nēþlō}}. Cognate with {{cog|nl|naald}}, {{cog|en|needle}}, common {{w|North Germanic languages|Continental Scandinavian}} ''[[nål]]''.

